    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35364" root="قر" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقْرُورٌ</span></b>  <i>Affected,</i> or <i>smitten, by the cold:</i> (S, M,
K:) from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَقَرَّهُ ٱللّٰهُ</span>, contr. to rule; as though
formed from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُرَّ</span>. (S.) [It seems that J was not
acquainted with the form <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُرَّ</span>, which is mentioned
in the M and K, or that he did not allow it.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرٌّ</span>.

